  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-usage-meter",
      "text": "DeepSeek Harness 用量统计插件：自动记录模型调用的 token 用量，按「模型 × 小时」聚合，在 Web GUI 设置页以堆叠柱状图展示（每小时一根柱子，按模型分色）。\n\n[🌐 English](README.en.md) · 中文"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "```sh\npnpm dsh plugin --profile web add @dsh-usage-meter/usage\n```\n\n> 刚发布当天若解析失败，显式钉版本（如 `@dsh-usage-meter/usage@0.3.0`）即可。\n\n重启 `dsh web`，设置 → 用量统计 即可查看。"
    },
    {
      "section": "卸载",
      "text": "```sh\npnpm dsh plugin --profile web remove @dsh-usage-meter/usage\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "数据",
      "text": "记录在 `$DSH_HOME/usage-meter/usage.jsonl`，启动时按小时重新聚合；界面中英双语，跟随 GUI 语言。"
    },
    {
      "section": "许可",
      "text": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-usage-meter",
      "text": "A DeepSeek Harness usage recorder: tracks token usage per model call, aggregates it by model × hour, and shows it in the Web GUI settings page as a stacked bar chart (one bar per hour, colored per model).\n\nEnglish · [中文](README.md)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh\npnpm dsh plugin --profile web add @dsh-usage-meter/usage\n```\n\n> If resolution fails on the publish day, pin the version explicitly (e.g. `@dsh-usage-meter/usage@0.3.0`).\n\nRestart `dsh web`, then open Settings → Usage."
    },
    {
      "section": "Uninstall",
      "text": "```sh\npnpm dsh plugin --profile web remove @dsh-usage-meter/usage\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Data",
      "text": "Stored at `$DSH_HOME/usage-meter/usage.jsonl`, re-aggregated hourly on startup; the UI is bilingual and follows the GUI language."
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    }
